{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/common/pokepicnic_cookinfo.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/common/pokepicnic_cookinfo.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_01",
      "hash64": "E49F22D8268DC8EF",
      "text": "只夾了火腿和奶油的三明治。\\n正因為樸實無華而無法矇騙味蕾。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_02",
      "hash64": "E49F23D8268DCAA2",
      "text": "增添了苦味的火腿奶油三明治。\\n愛吃苦味的人都一定會想吃吃看。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_03",
      "hash64": "E49F24D8268DCC55",
      "text": "增添了甜味的火腿奶油三明治。\\n體驗極致甜味的唯一選擇。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_04",
      "hash64": "E49F1DD8268DC070",
      "text": "增添了鹹味的火腿奶油三明治。\\n即使鹹味濃厚，卻十分好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_05",
      "hash64": "E49F1ED8268DC223",
      "text": "增添了酸味的火腿奶油三明治，\\n酸味鮮明使人口齒留香。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_06",
      "hash64": "E49F1FD8268DC3D6",
      "text": "增添了辣味的火腿奶油三明治。\\n沒吃過不能說自己愛吃辣。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_07",
      "hash64": "E49F20D8268DC589",
      "text": "堪稱苦味之極致的三明治。\\n別吝嗇你的調味料，加下去就對了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_08",
      "hash64": "E49F29D8268DD4D4",
      "text": "專為喜歡鹹味的內行人打造的三明治。\\n吃的時候必須要搭配飲料一起喝。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_09",
      "hash64": "E49F2AD8268DD687",
      "text": "甜到嚇人的三明治。\\n訣竅是多加一些調味料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_10",
      "hash64": "E4A2A7D82690E0C5",
      "text": "獻給酸味愛好者的三明治。\\n調味料越新鮮，酸味越強烈。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_11",
      "hash64": "E4A2A6D82690DF12",
      "text": "辣到舌頭如針刺的辛辣三明治。\\n不擅長吃辣的人切記要小心。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_12",
      "hash64": "E4A2A5D82690DD5F",
      "text": "只夾了果醬和草莓的三明治。\\n正因為樸實無華而讓人百吃不厭。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_13",
      "hash64": "E4A2A4D82690DBAC",
      "text": "加進優格凸顯了甜味，\\n整體味道的深度也更加明顯了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_14",
      "hash64": "E4A2A3D82690D9F9",
      "text": "分量十足，正餐點心皆適宜。\\n鳳梨選擇甜度高的為佳。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_15",
      "hash64": "E4A2A2D82690D846",
      "text": "透過調味料來使所有材料\\n融為一體的完美三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_16",
      "hash64": "E4A2A1D82690D693",
      "text": "花生醬和香蕉的組合意外搭調，\\n吃完會令人沉浸於飽足感當中。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_17",
      "hash64": "E4A2A0D82690D4E0",
      "text": "添加進奶油而成功實現了\\n紮實口感的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_18",
      "hash64": "E4A2AFD82690EE5D",
      "text": "加入果醬的甜味後，\\n更加提升了飽足感的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_19",
      "hash64": "E4A2AED82690ECAA",
      "text": "刻意加進強烈的辣味，\\n會讓吃的人莫名其妙上癮。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_20",
      "hash64": "E4A62DD82693FA4E",
      "text": "極度樸素的三明治。\\n建議可以多多講究橄欖油。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_21",
      "hash64": "E4A62ED82693FC01",
      "text": "酸黃瓜的酸味和豆瓣菜的風味，\\n就有如徐風吹過般搭調的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_22",
      "hash64": "E4A62BD82693F6E8",
      "text": "羅勒的香氣使得整體風味\\n變得更有層次的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_23",
      "hash64": "E4A62CD82693F89B",
      "text": "樸素且健康的三明治。\\n酸味強勁，後勁十足。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_24",
      "hash64": "E4A631D82694011A",
      "text": "樸素而實惠，但無損其美味。\\n以烘烤的方式提增風味亦佳。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_25",
      "hash64": "E4A632D8269402CD",
      "text": "因油的甜味而凸顯了酸味的三明治。\\n奶油切勿過量。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_26",
      "hash64": "E4A62FD82693FDB4",
      "text": "橘子醬越酸越美味。\\n是要稍微注意卡路里的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_27",
      "hash64": "E4A630D82693FF67",
      "text": "用來收尾的鹹味左右整體風味，\\n是整體平衡都需恰到好處的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_28",
      "hash64": "E4A625D82693ECB6",
      "text": "夾著帶有香草香的香腸\\n和番茄醬的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_29",
      "hash64": "E4A626D82693EE69",
      "text": "黃芥末醬的酸味和辣味\\n使整體滋味更有深度的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_30",
      "hash64": "E4A933D826963A57",
      "text": "以新鮮蔬菜和香腸\\n這對黃金組合做成的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_31",
      "hash64": "E4A932D8269638A4",
      "text": "味道最為主流的三明治。\\n苦味成功地使所有材料融合在了一起。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_32",
      "hash64": "E4A935D826963DBD",
      "text": "食材搭配奇妙的三明治。\\n咖哩粉先稍微熱過會更美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_33",
      "hash64": "E4A934D826963C0A",
      "text": "雖然加進辣味後變得更好入口了，\\n但這款三明治還是很挑人吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_34",
      "hash64": "E4A92FD82696338B",
      "text": "番茄的鮮味雖使整體變得更好入口，\\n卻仍然是挑人吃的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_35",
      "hash64": "E4A92ED8269631D8",
      "text": "辣味強烈、刺激感十足的三明治。\\n食材的組合依舊充滿野心。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_36",
      "hash64": "E4A931D8269636F1",
      "text": "最適合當成點心的三明治。\\n記得要用甜一點的優格來做喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_37",
      "hash64": "E4A930D82696353E",
      "text": "奇異果的綠美麗動人，\\n既好吃又養眼的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_38",
      "hash64": "E4A92BD826962CBF",
      "text": "內夾３種美味水果的三明治。\\n冰鎮後再吃也是極品。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_39",
      "hash64": "E4A92AD826962B0C",
      "text": "堪稱點心三明治的完美形態。\\n調味料的量不用多，足以提味即可。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_40",
      "hash64": "E491A9D8268270F8",
      "text": "酸味和鮮味的平衡是掌握美味的關鍵。\\n多加一些橘子醬是成功的秘訣。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_41",
      "hash64": "E491AAD8268272AB",
      "text": "鳳梨增添了熱帶風味，\\n是越酸越美味的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_42",
      "hash64": "E491ABD82682745E",
      "text": "能隱約感受到異國情調的三明治。\\n辣味的加入造就了味道的深度。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_43",
      "hash64": "E491ACD826827611",
      "text": "最配得上「熱帶」之名的三明治。\\n調味料鞏固了整體的味道。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_44",
      "hash64": "E491ADD8268277C4",
      "text": "三明治的滋味會隨酪梨的\\n後熟程度而變，讓人一嚐再嚐。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_45",
      "hash64": "E491AED826827977",
      "text": "味道實在的三明治。\\n選用的材料人人都愛，保證好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_46",
      "hash64": "E491AFD826827B2A",
      "text": "既實在又好吃的三明治。\\n不出差錯的材料帶來安心好滋味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_47",
      "hash64": "E491B0D826827CDD",
      "text": "滋味穩定，堪稱完美的三明治。\\n鹹味表現亮眼，吃起來十分美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_48",
      "hash64": "E491A1D826826360",
      "text": "開始盛行的時期及食譜的出處\\n皆不可考，謎團重重的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_49",
      "hash64": "E491A2D826826513",
      "text": "能帶來充分飽足感的三明治。\\n生菜的加入使其更容易入口。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_50",
      "hash64": "E4952FD826858A81",
      "text": "分量滿分的三明治。\\n辣香腸讓味覺變得更加豐富。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_51",
      "hash64": "E4952ED8268588CE",
      "text": "微微的苦味令人食指大動，\\n是能充分滿足食慾的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_52",
      "hash64": "E4952DD82685871B",
      "text": "健康卻分量十足的三明治，\\n味道好壞取決於馬鈴薯沙拉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_53",
      "hash64": "E4952CD826858568",
      "text": "以蔬菜為主卻能吃得滿足的三明治。\\n酪梨稍微偏硬也是蠻好吃的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_54",
      "hash64": "E49533D82685914D",
      "text": "蔬菜種類豐富的三明治。\\n內行人喜歡把口味調重。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_55",
      "hash64": "E49532D826858F9A",
      "text": "馬鈴薯沙拉三明治的完美形態。\\n味道的關鍵取決於帶有甜味的調味料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_56",
      "hash64": "E49531D826858DE7",
      "text": "以帶有辣味的醬汁，\\n襯托出蔬菜鮮甜滋味的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_57",
      "hash64": "E49530D826858C34",
      "text": "青椒的苦味與辣醬汁\\n十分搭配的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_58",
      "hash64": "E49527D826857CE9",
      "text": "能攝取足夠蔬菜的三明治。\\n辣醬汁帶出了蔬菜的鮮味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_59",
      "hash64": "E49526D826857B36",
      "text": "辣味與酸味均衡協調，\\n令人吃起來欲罷不能的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_60",
      "hash64": "E49835D82687CA8A",
      "text": "因調味樸素而備受喜愛的三明治。\\n盡情享受蛋最原始的風味吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_61",
      "hash64": "E49836D82687CC3D",
      "text": "洋蔥的甜味與口感襯托出了\\n蛋的豐富滋味，非常好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_62",
      "hash64": "E49833D82687C724",
      "text": "樸素的蛋三明治吃膩就改吃這個吧。\\n起司和蛋簡直是太速配了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_63",
      "hash64": "E49834D82687C8D7",
      "text": "蛋三明治的完美形態。\\n其亮點在於紮實的鹹味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_64",
      "hash64": "E49831D82687C3BE",
      "text": "夾著滿滿食材的三明治。\\n吃了以後不容易餓，深受年輕人歡迎。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_65",
      "hash64": "E49832D82687C571",
      "text": "調味料風味怡人的三明治。\\n烘蛋要熱熱的才好吃喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_66",
      "hash64": "E4982FD82687C058",
      "text": "能充分滿足食慾的三明治。\\n選用經過後熟的酪梨會更好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_67",
      "hash64": "E49830D82687C20B",
      "text": "分量滿分的三明治。\\n苦味讓整體風味變得更加協調。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_68",
      "hash64": "E4982DD82687BCF2",
      "text": "吃起來就像在吃沙拉的三明治。\\n多放一點番茄能有助身體健康喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_69",
      "hash64": "E4982ED82687BEA5",
      "text": "相當健康的三明治。\\n奇異果的酸味表現十分亮眼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_70",
      "hash64": "E49B9BD8268AADB3",
      "text": "只夾了蔬菜和水果的三明治，\\n不愛吃蔬菜的人也建議吃吃看。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_71",
      "hash64": "E49B9AD8268AAC00",
      "text": "調味以酸味為主，並對材料添上辣味，\\n就是足以令人上癮的好滋味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_72",
      "hash64": "E49B9DD8268AB119",
      "text": "最為正統的三明治。\\n雖普通卻經典，要難吃也很難。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_73",
      "hash64": "E49B9CD8268AAF66",
      "text": "羅勒的風味使人能稍微享受到\\n高級感的培根生菜番茄三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_74",
      "hash64": "E49B9FD8268AB47F",
      "text": "加入起司提升了飽足度。\\n味道調配得恰到好處的極品三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_75",
      "hash64": "E49B9ED8268AB2CC",
      "text": "淡淡的甜味維持了整體材料的協調，\\n如同奇跡般的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_76",
      "hash64": "E49BA1D8268AB7E5",
      "text": "馬鈴薯沙拉能中和炸物的油膩感，\\n是此款三明治不可或缺的角色。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_77",
      "hash64": "E49BA0D8268AB632",
      "text": "生菜的新鮮口感\\n與炸物相當速配的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_78",
      "hash64": "E49BA3D8268ABB4B",
      "text": "辣根爽口的辣味使整體變得\\n相當容易入口的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_79",
      "hash64": "E49BA2D8268AB998",
      "text": "增添辣味後變得十分好入口。\\n是炸魚片三明治的完美形態。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_80",
      "hash64": "E48431D826771AB4",
      "text": "廉價的味道才是精髓的三明治。\\n美乃滋一定要放好放滿。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_81",
      "hash64": "E48432D826771C67",
      "text": "夾進了２種火腿的三明治。\\n容易膩口卻相當美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_82",
      "hash64": "E48433D826771E1A",
      "text": "小辣椒刺激的辣味\\n襯托出了火腿鮮味的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_83",
      "hash64": "E48434D826771FCD",
      "text": "鹹味挑動味蕾的究極火腿三明治。\\n火腿夾越多，口感越幸福。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_84",
      "hash64": "E4842DD8267713E8",
      "text": "為愛吃起司的人所做的三明治。\\n調味樸素，易於入口。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_85",
      "hash64": "E4842ED82677159B",
      "text": "口感十分紮實的三明治。\\n酪梨稍微硬一些會更好吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_86",
      "hash64": "E4842FD82677174E",
      "text": "羅勒的香氣使人食指大動的三明治。\\n多加一些胡椒整體平衡會更好。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_87",
      "hash64": "E48430D826771901",
      "text": "強烈的鹹味使起司的濃郁鮮味\\n更加凸顯的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_88",
      "hash64": "E48429D826770D1C",
      "text": "以漢堡排為主角的三明治。\\n其亮點在於醋的酸味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_89",
      "hash64": "E4842AD826770ECF",
      "text": "以漢堡排為主角的三明治。\\n其亮點在於辣根的辣味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_90",
      "hash64": "E48737D826795ABD",
      "text": "以漢堡排為主角的三明治。\\n其亮點在於豆瓣菜的苦味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_91",
      "hash64": "E48736D82679590A",
      "text": "以漢堡排為主角的三明治。\\n其亮點在於調味料的甜味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_92",
      "hash64": "E48735D826795757",
      "text": "味道高雅的三明治。\\n調味料間的均衡調配很重要。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_93",
      "hash64": "E48734D8267955A4",
      "text": "味道清爽的三明治。\\n建議蔬菜不要放太多。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_94",
      "hash64": "E48733D8267953F1",
      "text": "味道優雅的三明治。\\n羅勒的香氣和魚片是絕配。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_95",
      "hash64": "E48732D82679523E",
      "text": "在一部分的人當中流傳著此款三明治\\n才是煙燻魚片最究極的吃法。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_96",
      "hash64": "E48731D82679508B",
      "text": "夾了許多水果的三明治。少放一些鮮奶油，\\n享受食材本身的風味才是聰明人的吃法。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_97",
      "hash64": "E48730D826794ED8",
      "text": "如同點心般的三明治。\\n橘子醬不用多，足以增添風味即可。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_98",
      "hash64": "E4872FD826794D25",
      "text": "如同在吃甜點般的三明治。\\n優格切勿過量。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_99",
      "hash64": "E4872ED826794B72",
      "text": "如同在吃甜點般的三明治。\\n調味料切勿過量。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_100",
      "hash64": "11442949882E404F",
      "text": "能品嚐到各種滋味的三明治。\\n各種材料的分量，請按喜好調整。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_101",
      "hash64": "11442849882E3E9C",
      "text": "馬鈴薯沙拉能帶來充分的飽足感，\\n是極受年輕人歡迎的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_102",
      "hash64": "11442B49882E43B5",
      "text": "多夾了漢堡排，分量十足。\\n調味料量偏多，廣受年輕人歡迎。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_103",
      "hash64": "11442A49882E4202",
      "text": "以最頂級的苦味融合整體材料，\\n是只有行家才懂其美味的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_104",
      "hash64": "11442549882E3983",
      "text": "口感十足且低卡路里，\\n是最適合用來減肥的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_105",
      "hash64": "11442449882E37D0",
      "text": "辣勁十足的醬汁叫人上癮，\\n是稍偏大人口味的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_106",
      "hash64": "11442749882E3CE9",
      "text": "趨近完美的三明治。\\n甜椒的口感是最大亮點。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_107",
      "hash64": "11442649882E3B36",
      "text": "增添辣味而使材料鮮味\\n更受凸顯的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_108",
      "hash64": "11443149882E4DE7",
      "text": "與水果三明治很相似的三明治。\\n不同之處及其亮點盡在奶油。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_109",
      "hash64": "11443049882E4C34",
      "text": "為凸顯食材的甜味，\\n而加了些許鹽巴的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_110",
      "hash64": "1140A349882B26C6",
      "text": "羅勒淡淡的苦味和其風味\\n使其他食材的優點更鮮明的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_111",
      "hash64": "1140A449882B2879",
      "text": "以酸味來提味的三明治。\\n調味料只需放極少量即可。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_112",
      "hash64": "1140A149882B2360",
      "text": "健康又多汁的三明治。\\n蔬菜的新鮮度將左右整體味道。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_113",
      "hash64": "1140A249882B2513",
      "text": "只夾了蔬菜的三明治。\\n整體味道取決於使用的調味料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_114",
      "hash64": "1140A749882B2D92",
      "text": "用蔬菜來決勝負的三明治。\\n多放一些豆瓣菜能更鞏固整體滋味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_115",
      "hash64": "1140A849882B2F45",
      "text": "蔬菜三明治的完美形態。\\n調味料的分量會大大影響整體水準。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_116",
      "hash64": "1140A549882B2A2C",
      "text": "只放了能滿足食慾的食材做成的\\n三明治。基本上只重視分量。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_117",
      "hash64": "1140A649882B2BDF",
      "text": "以讓人能吃飽來構想的三明治。\\n比起味道，更得把重點放在增加分量上。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_118",
      "hash64": "1140AB49882B345E",
      "text": "追求能吃飽的三明治。\\n吃的時候要注意健康。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_119",
      "hash64": "1140AC49882B3611",
      "text": "即使酸味使整體清香爽口，\\n但卻不影響攝取卡路里的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_120",
      "hash64": "113D3D498828439D",
      "text": "正如其名，是能吃到成熟滋味的三明治。\\n偏辣的蔬菜正是成熟滋味的象徵。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_121",
      "hash64": "113D3C49882841EA",
      "text": "調味料的分量難以調配的三明治。\\n羅勒的香氣使人食指大動。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_122",
      "hash64": "113D3B4988284037",
      "text": "增添辣味後，成熟滋味又更上層樓。\\n是很挑人吃的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_123",
      "hash64": "113D3A4988283E84",
      "text": "基本上很辣的三明治。\\n受不了刺激的人建議別吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_124",
      "hash64": "113D394988283CD1",
      "text": "以蔬菜為主的三明治。\\n獨特的醬汁使味蕾充滿刺激。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_125",
      "hash64": "113D384988283B1E",
      "text": "以蔬菜為主角的三明治。\\n有加小黃瓜的話，建議盡快食用為宜。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_126",
      "hash64": "113D37498828396B",
      "text": "獻給愛吃蔬菜的人的三明治。\\n美乃滋量不用多，足以提味即可。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_127",
      "hash64": "113D3649882837B8",
      "text": "為蔬菜而構想出的三明治。\\n淡淡的甜味更凸顯了蔬菜的鮮味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_128",
      "hash64": "113D354988283605",
      "text": "奶油的甜味和辣根的辣味\\n簡直是絕配的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_129",
      "hash64": "113D344988283452",
      "text": "能嚐到濃濃酪梨味的三明治。\\n味道取決於水果分量的調配。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_130",
      "hash64": "1139B74988252A14",
      "text": "甜味和辣味的調配最為重要。\\n加入滿滿的起司會更美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_131",
      "hash64": "1139B84988252BC7",
      "text": "提味用的苦味使整體偏甜辣的調味\\n變得更均衡協調的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_132",
      "hash64": "1139B94988252D7A",
      "text": "使用的材料風味強烈，所以這是\\n少放調味料才會好吃的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_133",
      "hash64": "1139BA4988252F2D",
      "text": "食材豪華且貴重的三明治。\\n豆腐大大增加了飽足感。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_134",
      "hash64": "1139B34988252348",
      "text": "不太好調配食材分量的三明治。\\n味道調濃一點會更美味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_135",
      "hash64": "1139B449882524FB",
      "text": "最上等的辣味統整了風格強烈的\\n各樣食材，是堪稱傑作的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_136",
      "hash64": "1139B549882526AE",
      "text": "食譜由愛吃豆腐的人所開發。\\n分量十足的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_137",
      "hash64": "1139B64988252861",
      "text": "製作難度稍高的三明治，\\n豆腐的水分要確確實實地瀝掉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_138",
      "hash64": "1139AF4988251C7C",
      "text": "味道平淡的豆腐與豆瓣菜的苦味\\n頗為搭調，相當不可思議的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_139",
      "hash64": "1139B04988251E2F",
      "text": "貴重的調味料中所含的鹹味，\\n使豆腐蘊藏的鮮味更加鮮明的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_140",
      "hash64": "113631498822108B",
      "text": "充滿挑戰精神的三明治。\\n咖哩粉記得先稍微炒過再用。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_141",
      "hash64": "1136304988220ED8",
      "text": "小辣椒刺激的辣味使咖哩的風味\\n更加鮮明的三明治。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_142",
      "hash64": "11363349882213F1",
      "text": "蛋就像一層膜一樣，\\n柔和了整體辛辣的調味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_143",
      "hash64": "113632498822123E",
      "text": "淡淡的甜味醞釀出的深度和層次感，\\n是此款三明治美味的關鍵。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_144",
      "hash64": "1136354988221757",
      "text": "誇張至極的三明治。\\n唯有分量才是正義。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_145",
      "hash64": "11363449882215A4",
      "text": "以分量作為中心思想的三明治。\\n並未提及味道究竟如何。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_146",
      "hash64": "1136374988221ABD",
      "text": "只注重分量的三明治。\\n調味調得好也是蠻好吃的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_147",
      "hash64": "113636498822190A",
      "text": "分量大卻能不失美味的原因\\n在於使用的調味料。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_148",
      "hash64": "11362949882202F3",
      "text": "以壽司為靈感構思出的三明治。\\n出乎意料地好吃，希望能驚艷到你。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_149",
      "hash64": "1136284988220140",
      "text": "參考壽司製作的三明治。\\n豆瓣菜的苦味非常突出。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_150",
      "hash64": "11332B49881FD082",
      "text": "愛吃壽司的人構思出的三明治。\\n其分量也是一大魅力。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "label": "pokepicnic_cookinfo_01_151",
      "hash64": "11332C49881FD235",
      "text": "壽司三明治的完美形態，\\n清爽的酸味堪稱極品。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
